  "data": {
    "summary": "When a **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)** weapon's attack scores a **critical wound**, its attack sequence stops; the target unit then suffers as many **mortal wounds** as the weapon's **D** characteristic, after any normal damage from those attacks. These mortal wounds can damage at most 1 model per critical wound; any left over are lost.\n\nWhat the **PSYKER** qualifier in this ability's name adds is not stated.",
